---
// IELTS Reading: "Matching headings" (IE02). Sahna: 3 paragrafli namuna matn va 4 sarlavha (bittasi ortiqcha).
// Misol qadamida faqat A paragraf (namuna, IE02 dagi kabi oldindan moslangan): asosiy fikr gapi va mos sarlavha ko'rsatiladi.
// Sinab ko'r qadamida A namuna bo'lib qoladi; foydalanuvchi B va C ni tanlaydi, keyin sarlavhani bosadi (bitta sarlavha bitta paragrafga); "Tekshirish" natijani beradi (saqlanmaydi).
// Paragraflar belgilashGuruh (<button aria-pressed>, strelka, Home/End); sarlavhalar oddiy <button>. Mashqlar DarsQolip da.
import { darsSavollari } from '../../../../../../data/ieltsDarslar';
import { yol } from '../../../../../../lib/yol';
import DarsQolip from '../../../../../../components/dars/DarsQolip.astro';

// Laboratoriya matni (o'ylab topilgan vaziyat, mashq emas)
const paragraflar = [
  {
    harf: 'A',
    gaplar: [
      'For more than a century, the clock above the town hall told the time for everyone in the square.',
      'Shopkeepers opened their doors by it, and buses left when its bell rang.',
    ],
    asosiy: [0],
    togri: 2,
    izoh: "The first sentence is the main idea: the whole town lived by the clock. The second sentence shows this with examples.",
  },
  {
    harf: 'B',
    gaplar: [
      'By the 1990s, however, almost everyone carried a watch or a phone.',
      'The clock often ran slow, and nobody hurried to repair it.',
    ],
    asosiy: [0, 1],
    togri: 3,
    izoh: "\"However\" signals a change: the clock is no longer needed. Both sentences together give this idea.",
  },
  {
    harf: 'C',
    gaplar: [
      'Last year, students from the technical college offered to restore it as a class project.',
      'After months of work, the clock keeps perfect time again, and its bell rings every hour.',
    ],
    asosiy: [0, 1],
    togri: 0,
    izoh: "Who (the students) and the result (the clock works again): the heading must cover both.",
  },
];
const sarlavhalar = [
  'Students bring the clock back to life',
  'How clocks are made',
  'A clock the whole town relied on',
  'A clock nobody needed any more',
];
const RIM = ['i', 'ii', 'iii', 'iv'];
---
<DarsQolip
  bolim="ielts"
  modul="ir-sarlavha"
  savollar={darsSavollari['ir-sarlavha']}
  yolBandlari={['Guides', 'Reading']}
  darsTuri="Reading lesson"
  imtihon="IELTS"
  manbalar={['IE02']}
  tekshirilgan="2026-11-06"
  keyingiTekshiruv="2026-12-06"
  title="Matching headings · IELTS"
  description="IELTS Reading: find the main idea of a paragraph and choose the heading that fits it. Spot the detail, key-word and too-broad traps. 5 exercises."
  yonalish="Matching headings"
  sarlavha="Matching headings: what is the paragraph about?"
  lead="A heading sums up the whole main idea of a paragraph, not one detail in it. There are more headings than paragraphs, so one is left over. Choose a paragraph, then tap the heading that fits it."
  qadamNomlari={['Example', 'Rule', 'Try it']}
  savolTili="en"
  savolKorsatma="Read the paragraph and choose the heading that best sums up its main idea."
  keyingi={{ nomi: '30-day plan', href: yol('/uz/ielts/vosita/reja/'), turi: 'qadam' }}
  maqsadlar={[
    "Separate a paragraph's main idea from the details that support it.",
    "Avoid choosing a heading just because it repeats a word from the text.",
    "Rule out headings that are too broad or add an idea the text does not have.",
  ]}
  xulosa={[
    "The heading covers the whole paragraph: both its beginning and its end.",
    "Examples and details are not the main idea: they illustrate it.",
    "The main idea often comes after words like \"however\" and \"in practice\".",
    "If a word from the paragraph appears in a heading, it may be a trap: check the meaning.",
    "Start with the pairs you are sure of; that leaves fewer headings to choose from.",
  ]}
  tekshirilmagan={[
    "The paragraphs and questions were written for Tayanch and the situations are made up; those the author has not checked are marked \"unchecked\".",
    "The trap types (detail, key word, too broad, rejected view) are Tayanch's own grouping, not an official classification.",
    "In the real test one list of headings is used for several paragraphs; in the exercises each question is one paragraph.",
  ]}
>
  <div slot="sahna">
    <div class="sahna-quti ir-quti">
      <p class="ir-namuna"><span class="pill">Sample</span> <span class="kichik ikkinchi">Made-up text</span></p>
      <div class="ir-paragraflar" id="ir-paragraflar" role="group" aria-label="Paragraphs">
        {paragraflar.map((p, k) => (
          <button type="button" class="ir-paragraf" data-bolak={k} aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="ir-p-bosh">
              <span class="ir-harf" aria-hidden="true">{p.harf}</span>
              <span class="ir-biriktirilgan" data-biriktirilgan={k}>Heading: not chosen</span>
            </span>
            <span class="ir-p-matn" lang="en">
              {p.gaplar.map((g, j) => <span class="ir-gap" data-gap={j}>{g} </span>)}
            </span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="ir-sarlavhalar">
        <p class="kichik ikkinchi">Headings (one is extra)</p>
        <ul class="ir-s-royxat">
          {sarlavhalar.map((s, k) => (
            <li><button type="button" class="ir-sarlavha" data-sarlavha={k} aria-pressed="false"><span class="ir-rim" aria-hidden="true">{RIM[k]}</span><span lang="en">{s}</span></button></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="sahna-izoh" id="ir-holat" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <script type="application/json" id="ir-data" set:html={JSON.stringify({ paragraflar, sarlavhalar, RIM })} />
  </div>

  <div slot="animatsiya">
    <p>Paragraph A is an example: in the test, too, one paragraph is sometimes matched for you. On the stage the main-idea sentence is underlined and the matching heading has a blue background.</p>
    <div class="formula"><span class="kichik ikkinchi">Why</span><span class="f-qiymat ir-qoida" id="ir-misol-izoh">{paragraflar[0].izoh}</span></div>
    <div class="segment"><button type="button" class="t-tugma ielts-tugma--urgu" data-qadamga="sinab">Let me match them</button></div>
  </div>

  <div slot="formula">
    <dl class="ir-qoidalar">
      <div><dt>Main idea</dt><dd>Every sentence in the paragraph serves this idea. The heading covers it.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Detail</dt><dd>One example, number or fact. It illustrates the main idea but is not a heading itself.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Key-word trap</dt><dd>A word from the paragraph is in the heading, but the meaning is different.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Too broad</dt><dd>The topic is general, but the paragraph is about one case of it.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div slot="sinab">
    <div class="vazifa">
      <p><b>Task.</b> Paragraph A is the example. For B and C: tap a paragraph on the stage, then tap the heading that fits it. Each heading goes with only one paragraph. When everything is ready, check.</p>
      <p class="vazifa-holat" id="ir-sinab-holat" aria-live="polite">Nothing matched yet.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="segment">
      <button type="button" class="t-tugma ielts-tugma--urgu" id="ir-tekshir">Check</button>
      <button type="button" class="t-tugma t-tugma--ikkinchi" id="ir-qayta">Start again</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</DarsQolip>

<script>
  import { belgilashGuruhi } from '../../../../../../lib/belgilashGuruh';

  type Paragraf = { harf: string; gaplar: string[]; asosiy: number[]; togri: number; izoh: string };
  const { paragraflar, sarlavhalar, RIM } = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('ir-data')!.textContent || '{}') as { paragraflar: Paragraf[]; sarlavhalar: string[]; RIM: string[] };
  const $ = (id: string) => document.getElementById(id)!;
  const holat = $('ir-sinab-holat');
  const sTugmalar = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-sarlavha]')];
  let qadam = 'animatsiya';
  const NAMUNA = 0;
  let tekshirildi = false;
  /** paragraf indeksi → sarlavha indeksi yoki -1 (namuna paragraf doim moslangan) */
  const boshJuft = () => paragraflar.map((p, k) => (k === NAMUNA ? p.togri : -1));
  let juft: number[] = boshJuft();

  const g = belgilashGuruhi($('ir-paragraflar'), (k) => {
    if (qadam !== 'sinab') return;
    holat.textContent = k >= 0 ? `Paragraph ${paragraflar[k].harf} selected. Now tap a heading.` : holatMatni();
    holat.dataset.ok = '';
  });

  const holatMatni = () => {
    const n = juft.filter((x, k) => k !== NAMUNA && x >= 0).length;
    return n ? `Headings given to ${n} / ${paragraflar.length - 1} paragraphs.` : 'Nothing matched yet.';
  };

  function biriktirilganYoz() {
    paragraflar.forEach((p, k) => {
      const el = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-biriktirilgan="${k}"]`)!;
      el.textContent = juft[k] >= 0 ? `Heading ${RIM[juft[k]]}${k === NAMUNA ? ' (example)' : ''}` : 'Heading: not chosen';
    });
    sTugmalar.forEach((t, j) => t.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(juft.includes(j))));
    sTugmalar[paragraflar[NAMUNA].togri].disabled = true;
  }
  function tozala() {
    document.querySelectorAll('.ir-gap').forEach((x) => x.classList.remove('ir-asosiy'));
    document.querySelectorAll('.ir-paragraf, .ir-sarlavha').forEach((x) => x.classList.remove('ir-togri', 'ir-xato'));
  }

  function chizMisol() {
    tozala();
    g.tanla(-1);
    g.faol(false);
    const p = paragraflar[NAMUNA];
    juft = boshJuft();
    biriktirilganYoz();
    sTugmalar.forEach((t) => { t.disabled = true; });
    g.tugmalar[NAMUNA].classList.add('ir-togri');
    p.asosiy.forEach((j) => g.tugmalar[NAMUNA].querySelector(`[data-gap="${j}"]`)!.classList.add('ir-asosiy'));
    sTugmalar[p.togri].classList.add('ir-togri');
    $('ir-holat').textContent = `Paragraph ${p.harf}: heading ${RIM[p.togri]}, “${sarlavhalar[p.togri]}”. ${p.izoh}`;
  }
  function chizSinov() {
    tozala();
    tekshirildi = false;
    juft = boshJuft();
    g.faol(true);
    g.tugmalar[NAMUNA].disabled = true;
    g.tugmalar[NAMUNA].classList.add('ir-togri');
    sTugmalar.forEach((t) => { t.disabled = false; });
    biriktirilganYoz();
    sTugmalar[paragraflar[NAMUNA].togri].classList.add('ir-togri');
    const birinchi = paragraflar.findIndex((_, k) => k !== NAMUNA);
    g.tanla(birinchi);
    holat.textContent = 'Hali biriktirilmagan.'; holat.dataset.ok = '';
    $('ir-holat').textContent = `A paragraf namuna. ${paragraflar[birinchi].harf} paragraf tanlangan: sarlavhani bosing.`;
  }
  function chiz() { if (qadam === 'sinab') chizSinov(); else chizMisol(); }

  sTugmalar.forEach((t, j) => t.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (qadam !== 'sinab') return;
    const k = g.tanlangan();
    if (k < 0 || k === NAMUNA) { holat.textContent = 'First choose paragraph B or C.'; holat.dataset.ok = ''; return; }
    if (tekshirildi) { g.tugmalar.forEach((t, i) => { if (i !== NAMUNA) t.classList.remove('ir-togri', 'ir-xato'); }); tekshirildi = false; }
    juft = juft.map((x) => (x === j ? -1 : x));
    juft[k] = j;
    biriktirilganYoz();
    const keyingi = juft.findIndex((x, i) => i !== NAMUNA && x < 0);
    holat.textContent = `Heading ${RIM[j]} given to paragraph ${paragraflar[k].harf}. ${holatMatni()}`;
    holat.dataset.ok = '';
    if (keyingi >= 0) { g.tanla(keyingi); g.tugmalar[keyingi].focus(); } else g.tanla(-1);
  }));

  $('ir-tekshir').addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (qadam !== 'sinab') return;
    if (juft.some((x) => x < 0)) { holat.textContent = `Hamma paragrafga sarlavha bering. ${holatMatni()}`; holat.dataset.ok = ''; return; }
    tekshirildi = true;
    const xatolar: string[] = [];
    paragraflar.forEach((p, k) => {
      if (k === NAMUNA) return;
      g.tugmalar[k].classList.remove('ir-togri', 'ir-xato');
      const ok = juft[k] === p.togri;
      g.tugmalar[k].classList.add(ok ? 'ir-togri' : 'ir-xato');
      if (!ok) xatolar.push(`${p.harf} (you: ${RIM[juft[k]]}, correct: ${RIM[p.togri]}): ${p.izoh}`);
    });
    const jami = paragraflar.length - 1;
    if (!xatolar.length) {
      holat.textContent = `All correct. The extra heading: ${RIM[1]}, “${sarlavhalar[1]}”: it has the word "clock", but the text is not about making clocks.`;
      holat.dataset.ok = '1';
    } else {
      holat.textContent = `${jami - xatolar.length} / ${jami} correct. ${xatolar.join(' ')} Change the heading and check again.`;
      holat.dataset.ok = '';
    }
  });
  $('ir-qayta').addEventListener('click', () => { chizSinov(); g.tugmalar[g.tanlangan()]?.focus(); });
  document.addEventListener('dars:qadam', (e) => { qadam = (e as CustomEvent).detail.qadam; chiz(); });
  chiz();
</script>

<style is:global>
  .ir-quti { padding: var(--space-5); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); }
  .ir-namuna { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .ir-paragraflar { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); }
  .ir-paragraf {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); width: 100%; text-align: left;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); min-height: 48px;
    background: var(--color-ielts-bg); color: var(--color-ielts-text); font: inherit; cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-ielts-line); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) { .ir-paragraf:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--color-ielts-accent-text); } }
  .ir-paragraf:focus-visible, .ir-sarlavha:focus-visible { outline: var(--focus-ring-width) solid var(--color-focus-ring); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .ir-paragraf[aria-pressed='true'] { border-color: var(--color-ielts-accent-text); box-shadow: inset 4px 0 0 var(--color-ielts-accent-text); }
  .ir-paragraf:disabled { cursor: default; }
  .ir-paragraf.ir-togri { background: var(--color-ielts-tile); border-color: var(--color-ielts-accent-text); }
  .ir-paragraf.ir-xato { border-style: dashed; border-color: var(--color-ielts-text); }
  .ir-p-bosh { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .ir-harf { width: 28px; height: 28px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-ielts-text); color: var(--color-ielts-bg); font-weight: var(--font-weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-small-size); }
  .ir-biriktirilgan { font-size: var(--text-caption-size); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); color: var(--color-ielts-text-muted); }
  .ir-p-matn { line-height: 1.6; }
  .ir-gap.ir-asosiy { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 4px; font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); }
  .ir-s-royxat { list-style: none; margin: var(--space-2) 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .ir-sarlavha {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); width: 100%; min-height: 48px; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4); text-align: left;
    background: var(--color-ielts-bg); color: var(--color-ielts-text); font: inherit; font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-ielts-line); border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) { .ir-sarlavha:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--color-ielts-accent-text); } }
  .ir-sarlavha[aria-pressed='true'] { border-color: var(--color-ielts-accent-text); }
  .ir-sarlavha:disabled { cursor: default; }
  .ir-sarlavha.ir-togri { background: var(--color-ielts-tile); border-color: var(--color-ielts-accent-text); }
  .ir-rim { min-width: 32px; font-weight: var(--font-weight-extrabold); color: var(--color-link); }
  .dars .ir-qoida { font-size: var(--text-body-size); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); line-height: 1.5; }
  .ir-qoidalar { margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .ir-qoidalar div { background: var(--color-ielts-tile); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); }
  .ir-qoidalar dt { font-weight: var(--font-weight-extrabold); }
  .ir-qoidalar dd { margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-ielts-text-muted); }
</style>
